"""Transcribed constants for scripts/mission_cf_fee_census.py (P-NEW-CFC-01, 2026-11-15).

Every value is copied from the cited public source; nothing is estimated. Fee schedules carry verbatim `quotes` that the
census task checks (whitespace-normalised, case-insensitive) against the cached copy of the source. Sources read only via
WebFetch or search capture cannot be checked by the script and are labelled so.

tiers: ((lower_usd, upper_usd or None, annual_rate_pct), ...). basis: marginal | flat_on_total.
status values:
  published_schedule        full standard-DAF admin schedule from a 2021+ first-party source (enters the distribution)
  published_schedule_pre2021 full schedule, but source dated before 2021 (recency rule: recorded, not used)
  noninvested_flat          flat $ fee on a fund that is not invested (income kept by the CF); not comparable
  grant_or_gift_based       fee charged on grants or gifts rather than balance; not comparable at constant balance
  partial                   some published terms (headline rate, range, minimum) but no full schedule
  no_rates_published        fee page or policy found, rates not stated ("on request", "varies")
  (absent)                  not_found: no fee terms found by homepage/sitemap crawl + site-restricted search
"""

